==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 4~13.33 seconds<sup>120f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[The Face|Faces]] spawn, delay 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>.
*10 [[Kory|Kories]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*3 [[Dober P.D]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*10 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn, delay 0.2~0.67 seconds<sup>6f~20f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Having [[Wave Shield|Wave Blocker]] units (like [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]]) makes this stage a lot easier if not trivial. If not, make sure to minimize the usage of meatshields as you'll want Dober to send as little waves as possible. Mid-ranged AoE attackers like [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] and [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] are heavily recommended to deal with the Pigeon waves. Wave Attackers like [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]] also helps here.

